    <p>Getafe vs Brighton in the UEFA Conference League is on Thursday 5 November 2026 at the Coliseum in Getafe (date per UEFA's fixture list).</p><p>Staying in central Madrid? We show it LIVE at Dubliners, an Irish pub on Calle de Espoz y Mina 7, just off Puerta del Sol. Kick-off time is on <a href={withBase('/whats-on/')}>What's On</a>.</p><p>Metro Sol (L1, L2, L3) or Sevilla (L2). Open every day from 12:00.</p>
